<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metromail started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metromail started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of Metromail Corp and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- sees industry fundamentals and Metromail's competitive strength allowing company to sustain 20-25 percent earnings per share growth through the rest of the decade.</p>
<p>-- set a near-term price target of $25 a share.</p>
<p>-- Metromail gained 1-1/8 to 19-3/4 in late trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
